OL,3,AStorm Boelo to bring more wind and rain
OL,4,Aas hundreds still hit by Austen power
OL,5,Acuts
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Friday, Austen hit southern England,
OL,8,Fthe Channel Islands, and parts of
OL,9,FWales, with gusts of up 84mph recorded
OL,10,Fin Jersey
OL,12,FTens of thousands of properties lost
OL,13,Fpower in south-west England - hundreds
OL,14,Fare still waiting to be reconnected on
OL,15,FSaturday
